00:32:05.880 --> 00:32:08.460
Just as those different
interpretations you can have

00:32:08.460 --> 00:32:10.014
of the quantum mechanics mathematics,

00:32:10.014 --> 00:32:13.650
you can have different
interpretations in this sort of way.

00:32:13.650 --> 00:32:14.650
It's a free for all.

00:32:16.914 --> 00:32:18.030
